  "translation": "San filanan na, u ka na Elohim ka so kɔnɔ, Yerushalayim (Yerusalɛmu), kalo filanan na, u daminɛ — Zerubabeli (Zerubabeli), Shealtieli (Saltieli) denkɛ, ni Yeshua (Jeshua), Yotsadaki (Jozadaki) denkɛ, ni u balimakɛw tɔɔrɛ, sarakalasebagaw ani Lewiw (Levi) dencɛw, ani mɔgɔ bɛɛ minnu bɔra dancɛ (captivité) la ka na Yerushalayim — u ye ⟨את⟩ Lewiw dencɛw sigi san mugan ni a sanba la, ka ɲɛmɔ kɛ baara la Yawe so kɔnɔ.",
